 so nothing slips through. Choose sound, vibration, or both. Reminders run locally — no push server required.\n\nORGANIZE YOUR WAY\nSort by created date, due date, or priority. Filter by All, Pending, or Completed. Use Work and Personal categories, plus focus views for Due Soon, High Priority, and Overdue to find what matters right now.\n\nQUICK CAPTURE\nAdd a task in seconds from the home screen — title, optional due date, priority, and category. Need more detail? Expand the form for descriptions and richer metadata.\n\nINSIGHTS & STATS\nSee your total, pending, completed, and overdue counts at a glance, with progress tracking and time-of-day statistics to help you understand your patterns.\n\nBULK ACTIONS\nComplete every overdue task in one tap, or clear all completed tasks to keep your list tidy.\n\nLOCAL BACKUP & RESTORE\nExport your tasks to a JSON backup file and share it anywhere via the system share sheet. Import it back anytime — the file format is verified on read to keep your data safe.\n\nTRANSPARENT & AUDITABLE\nA built-in local audit log records key actions (task created, updated, deleted, exported, imported) so you can self-check before review. The audit log never leaves your device.\n\nWORKS OFFLINE, STAYS OFFLINE\nOnce installed, TaskGuard Pro needs no internet connection. It only asks for notification permission — and only when you enable reminders.\n\nBILINGUAL\nFull interface in English and 简体中文, switchable anytime in Settings.\n\nKEY FEATURES\n• 100% offline — no accounts, no cloud, no tracking\n• Locally encrypted storage (AES-256 via SQLCipher)\n• Due-date and overdue local notifications\n• Sort by date / priority / created time\n• Filter, category, and focus views\n• One-tap bulk complete and bulk clear\n• Stats with progress and time-of-day breakdown\n• JSON backup export & verified import\n• Local audit log for transparency\n• Privacy policy included in-app\n\nTaskGuard Pro is built for people who want a capable to-do list without giving up their privacy.", "trackCensoredName": "TaskGuard Pro", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/taskguard-pro/id6787708276?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "averageUserRating": 0, "bundleId": "com.taskguard.yqapp", "trackId": 6787708276, "trackName": "TaskGuard Pro", "userRatingCount": 0}]}